{"unit_id": "tag:06G9:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n环（ring）是交换的（commutative），且满足<MATH_0001>。局部环（local ring）<MATH_0002>的极大理想（maximal ideal）记为<MATH_0003>。正整数（positive integers）的集合（set）记为<MATH_0004>。若<MATH_0005>是范畴（category）<MATH_0006>的对象（object），则用<MATH_0007>表示函子（functor）<MATH_0008>，见注记<REF_0001>（<REF_0002>）。注意：这可能与其他章节中的记号冲突，那里我们有时用<MATH_0009>表示<MATH_0010>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n本章始终设<MATH_0011>是诺特环（Noetherian ring），而<MATH_0012>是从<MATH_0013>到域（field）的有限环映射（finite ring map）。这个映射（map）的核（kernel）记为<MATH_0014>，像（image）记为<MATH_0015>。事实上，<MATH_0016>是极大理想（maximal ideal），<MATH_0017>是域（field），而扩张（extension）<MATH_0018>是有限的（finite）。见（<REF_0003>）附近的讨论。\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换的"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "maximal ideal", "target_term": "极大理想"}, {"source_term": "positive integers", "target_term": "正整数"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "Noetherian ring", "target_term": "诺特环"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "finite ring map", "target_term": "有限环映射"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "maximal ideal", "target_term": "极大理想"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extension", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限的"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "所约定环，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换的", "context": "环性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "local ring", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "所给环，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "maximal ideal", "target_term": "极大理想", "context": 