{"unit_id": "tag:06GB:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n动机。形式形变理论（formal deformation theory）的一个重要应用是代数空间（algebraic spaces）可表性（representability）的判据。假设给定局部诺特的（locally Noetherian）底（base）<MATH_0001>和函子（functor）<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>上的有限型（finite type）域（field），即给定有限型（finite type）态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>。Artin 的一个判据要求：对任意元素（element）<MATH_0006>，与三元组（triple）<MATH_0007>关联的预形变函子（predeformation functor）应为逆极限可表的（prorepresentable）。由态射（Morphisms）一章的引理<REF_0001>，<MATH_0008>在<MATH_0009>上为有限型（finite type）这一条件意味着存在仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0010>，使得<MATH_0011>是有限（finite）<MATH_0012>-代数（algebra）。这解释了为何本章始终使用如下的底范畴（base category）。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Artin"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "formal deformation theory", "target_term": "形式形变理论"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "representability", "target_term": "可表性"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特的"}, {"source_term": "base", "target_term": "底"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"source_term": "predeformation functor", "target_term": "预形变函子"}, {"source_term": "prorepresentable", "target_term": "逆极限可表的"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "base category", "target_term": "底范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "formal deformation theory", "target_term": "形式形变理论", "context": "所述理论，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "可表对象，译法待决"}, {"source_term"