{"unit_id": "tag:06GB:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，若<MATH_0001>是满射的（surjective），且<MATH_0002>是 Artin 局部（Artinian local）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebra），则识别（identification）<MATH_0004>若存在就是唯一的。此外，此时任意<MATH_0005>-代数映射（algebra map）<MATH_0006>都会与这些识别（identifications）相容。因此，此时<MATH_0007>恰为局部 Artin（local Artinian）<MATH_0008>-代数（algebras）的范畴（category），其剩余域（residue field）“是”<MATH_0009>。在一般情形，我们也滥用记号，直接用<MATH_0011>表示<MATH_0010>的对象（objects）。此外，我们常写<MATH_0012>，即假定<MATH_0013>中的所有环（rings）都具有剩余域（residue field）<MATH_0014>（因为<MATH_0015>中的所有环映射（ring maps）都与给定识别（identifications）相容，这应该绝不会导致任何问题）。本章其余部分始终固定底环（base ring）<MATH_0016>和域（field）<MATH_0017>。范畴（category）<MATH_0018>将作为下文所考虑的余纤维化范畴（cofibered categories）的底范畴（base category）。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Artin"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "Artinian local", "target_term": "Artin 局部"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "identification", "target_term": "识别"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射"}, {"source_term": "identifications", "target_term": "识别"}, {"source_term": "local Artinian", "target_term": "局部 Artin"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "residue field", "target_term": "剩余域"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "identifications", "target_term": "识别"}, {"source_term": "base ring", "target_term": "底环"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "cofibered categories", "target_term": "余纤维化范畴"}, {"source_term": "base category", "target_term": "底范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的", "context": "环映射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "Artinian local", "ta