{"unit_id": "tag:06GD:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>中的环映射（ring map）。若<MATH_0003>是满射的（surjective），且<MATH_0004>是被<MATH_0005>零化（annihilated）的非零（nonzero）主理想（principal ideal），则我们称其为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>小扩张（small extension）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的"}, {"source_term": "annihilated", "target_term": "零化"}, {"source_term": "nonzero", "target_term": "非零"}, {"source_term": "principal ideal", "target_term": "主理想"}, {"source_term": "small extension", "target_term": "小扩张"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "所给映射，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射的", "context": "映射性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "annihilated", "target_term": "零化", "context": "核理想的零化性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "nonzero", "target_term": "非零", "context": "理想性质，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "principal ideal", "target_term": "主理想", "context": "所给核理想，译法待决"}, {"source_term": "small extension", "target_term": "小扩张", "context": "所定义扩张，译法待决"}], "notes": []}
